# Build output. Non-negotiable: a release build of this workspace is
# ~500 MB of target/, and templedb's importer walks the tree — letting it
# in would put build artifacts in content_blobs, which is already the
# largest table in the database at 470 MB.
/target/
**/target/

# Rust/Cargo
Cargo.lock.bak
*.rs.bk
*.pdb

# Nix
result
result-*
.direnv/
